  "source_judgment": "The named controller identity, first-default-pair position, common live first-field conversion/index forwarding and common raw provider qualify driver-requested idle threshold semantics. Missing registry-to-parent copying limits initialization provenance, not this live control. This is a source-based naming/unit inference; physical effects remain unmeasured.",
  "source_audits": [
    {
      "scope": "Offline bounded DIFR controller10/11 first-threshold source audit. No hardware, registry or product mutations.",
      "driver_sha256": "db407b964c11441642a1642a0922c35990de974c267a08537c3432765365f84b",
      "findings": [
        "734600 registry selector switch names controller10 RMLpwrMsDifrSwAsrIdleThresholdUs and controller11 RMLpwrMsDifrCgIdleThresholdUs, writing the per-controller group field group+124+index*108: +B74 and +C7C respectively. No path copying those group fields into parent+974/+978 was established.",
        "B98010 constructor uses parent RDX; EBp=0x96 at B982D2 and writes both parent+974 and parent+978 from EBP at B988AA/B0, giving 150 for both on that constructor path.",
        "A distinct producer is 5E3490: it loads parent=[GPU+2550] into R15, then passes its input object and stack buffer to parser helper 1881D0 at 5E3547. On successful return 5E358E..5E35A1 copies buffer DWORDs [RBP+17] and [RBP+1B] into parent+974 and +978, respectively. Caller 5E1AC0 obtains a value via 183F30, checks version byte 0x10 through 187E50, then passes that input object and value to 5E3490. Exact primary definition and units of the parsed fields remain unbound.",
        "737120 index10 and index11 select parent+974 and +978, respectively, as the first default-generator input before the same mode-dependent conversion used in the established GR path. E802 3A constructs the first live field for a selected controller. These are numeric associations; they do not alone prove that the two registry-named group values feed those parent fields or that the BIOS-like parsed values have a particular unit.",
        "Do not claim the complete registry-name to first-live-field naming/unit join for 10/11 without the missing group-to-parent consumer, authoritative definition of parsed input fields, or another concrete equivalent source. This conclusion does not state that no other such path exists."
      ],
